    <Description>
        <ShortDescription>Watchdog</ShortDescription>
        <LongDescription>Hardware watchdog timer. Enables/disables the watchdog and provides a kick (heartbeat) function to prevent a system reset if the application stops responding.</LongDescription>
        <UserName/>
        <Menu>
            Peripherals
            <Menu>Watchdog</Menu>

        </Menu>
    </Description>
